<title>USA: General Employment Q4 Sept 30 net higher.</title>
<headline>General Employment Q4 Sept 30 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>OAKBROOK TERRACE, Ill. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter	 Year</p>
<p>					 1996    1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net revenues		    $6,386  $4,571  $23,241  $16,744</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>   Cost of services	     4,535   3,312   16,717   12,652</p>
<p>   General and administrative   947     837    3,813    2,874</p>
<p> Income before income taxes     904     422    2,711    1,218</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes(A)  360	55    1,070	150</p>
<p> Net income			   544     367    1,641    1,068</p>
<p> Net income per share(B)	 0.20    0.14     0.63     0.42</p>
<p> Average number of shares(B)  2,667   2,577    2,596    2,545</p>
<p>(A) The effective income tax rates for the 1995 periods differ from the expected rates because of reversals of a previously-recorded deferred income tax valuation allowance.</p>
<p>(B) Share and per share amounts for all periods have been adjusted to reflect a 15 percent stock dividend paid November 1, 1996.</p>
<p>	     (In Thousands, Except Per Share)</p>
<p>		 Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
